<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Spectre Search - Service Notice</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-deep: #050b18;
            --accent-cyan: #00f2fe;
            --accent-blue: #4facfe;
            --glass-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --glass-glow: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --status-red: #ff5555;
            --status-red-bg: rgba(255, 85, 85, 0.15);
            --status-red-border: rgba(255, 85, 85, 0.3);
            --btn-github-bg: #0d1117;
            --btn-github-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-deep);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.7;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Ambient Glow Background Spheres */
        .glow-sphere-1 {
            position: fixed;
            top: -10%;
            left: 20%;
            width: 50vw;
            height: 50vw;
            max-width: 600px;
            max-height: 600px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .glow-sphere-2 {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: -10%;
            right: 20%;
            width: 50vw;
            height: 50vw;
            max-width: 600px;
            max-height: 600px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(79, 172, 254, 0.1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        /* Full Width Wrapper */
        .page-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 24px;
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            padding: 20px 0 0;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 30%, var(--accent-cyan) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--status-red-bg);
            color: var(--status-red);
            border: 1px solid var(--status-red-border);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        /* Full-width Glass Panel for Content */
        .glass-panel {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .glass-panel:hover {
            border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 25px var(--glass-glow);
        }

        h2.notice-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .description {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
        }

        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--glass-border);
            margin: 28px 0;
        }

        .repo-section h3 {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Black GitHub Button */
        .btn-github {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffffff;
            background-color: var(--btn-github-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--btn-github-border);
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-github svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        .btn-github:hover {
            background-color: #161b22;
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px 0;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            opacity: 0.7;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Mobile & Tablet Adjustments */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .page-wrapper {
                padding: 24px 16px;
            }

            .glass-panel {
                padding: 24px;
                border-radius: 16px;
            }

            header {
                margin-bottom: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="glow-sphere-1"></div>
    <div class="glow-sphere-2"></div>

    <div class="page-wrapper">
        <header>
            <h1>Spectre Search</h1>
            <div>
                <span class="status-badge">● Service Down</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="glass-panel">
            <h2 class="notice-title">Maintenance & Service Issues</h2>
            <p class="description">
                Spectre Search is currently down due to hosting and server maintenance problems. We're looking into it and working on getting things back up & running.
            </p>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="repo-section">
                <h3>Visit the Spectre Search GitHub Repository</h3>
                <a href="https://github.com/WavierPigeon261/spectre-search" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-github">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <span>View on GitHub ↗</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>© Spectre Technologies. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
